    "description": "Fukuyama Transporting Co., Ltd. operates as a logistics company in Japan, China, Hong Kong, Cambodia, Vietnam, Indonesia, Malaysia and Thailand. It operates through the Transporting, Chartered Transportation Services, Logistics, and International Operations segments. The company offers freight transportation services using approximately 16,000 vehicles that include tractors, trailers, and large and small trucks, sea, rail and air. It also provides warehousing, packaging, and port operations; customs clearance and freight handling; security; staffing; and vehicle maintenance services. In addition, the company operates real estate rental, convenience stores, and insurance and travel agencies. Additionally, it engages in port operations; sports and recreational facilities management; industrial and household waste collection and disposal; printing; agency for liability insurance; life insurance sales promotion; and product sale and sale on consignment businesses. Fukuyama Transporting Co., Ltd. was incorporated in 1948 and is headquartered in Fukuyama, Japan."
